@prefix ex: <https://example.org/learning/> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

ex:LearningResource a owl:Class .
ex:TextResource a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ex:LearningResource .
ex:Article a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ex:TextResource .
ex:Course a owl:Class ; rdfs:subClassOf ex:LearningResource .
ex:Person a owl:Class .
ex:Topic a owl:Class .
ex:SourceRecord a owl:Class .
ex:authoredBy a rdf:Property ; rdfs:domain ex:LearningResource ; rdfs:range ex:Person .
ex:coversTopic a rdf:Property ; rdfs:domain ex:LearningResource ; rdfs:range ex:Topic .
ex:sourceRecord a rdf:Property ; rdfs:range ex:SourceRecord .
ex:row a rdf:Property .
